The voice addressing preview downloads, at the operator's request, a speech
model that is not distributed with this product. Its files are fetched from
Hugging Face at pinned commits and kept in the state home:

  NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2, Core ML conversion by FluidInference
  https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-coreml
  (commit ee09c569f73759e6d44c9bd16766f477b2b36d39), based on
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2

  NVIDIA Parakeet TDT-CTC 110M, Core ML conversion by FluidInference
  https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-ctc-110m-coreml
  (commit accdafd8cf8a2ff1cabe3c11e54416b405d409aa), based on
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt_ctc-110m

Both models are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
